*  RED, CHECKED IN RED (law 0d).  The IDENTICAL pattern stored in a variable first hangs
*  EXACTLY like the inline twin rty_arbno_leftctx_inline -- this rules out the inline-vs-
*  stored/blob dichotomy that explained the BAL/ARB family (s192): here BOTH roads are red,
*  so the defect is in ARBNO's own retry state, not in which road compiles the pattern.
*  ⛔ CAPTURE STDOUT WITH A HARD timeout WHEN RUNNING THIS -- SCRIP DOES NOT TERMINATE.
	&ANCHOR = 1
	subj = "this is a test ."
	p = BREAK(' ') ARBNO(LEN(1))
	subj p $ OUTPUT '.'
END
